  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity development One-Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Veterinarian institute will build capacity in selected African countries and institutions like COMESA and AU-IBAR  in the field of One-Health, including zoonosis, AMR and veterinarian services. 

In the first phase of the project period (October 2021 to June 2022), we will establish contact and build networks with similar competence environments in AU-IBAR and COMESA to identify knowledge gaps within One-Health in the COMESA countries that fall under the following of VI&apos;s competence areas:

1.	Competence building in epidemiology for veterinarians &#x2013; strengthening veterinary public health in articulating with public health 
2.	Training in primary diagnostic investigations / Laboratory capacity 
3.	Strengthening of veterinary services for improving livestock health</narrative>
  </description>
